mask_refine.preview_note = Igaragazambere ryagabanyijwe kugira ngo ryihute. Ingano z'inkombe zipimirwa muri pigiseli z'inyandiko; Gushyiraho bikoresha ingano yuzuye. Kwegereza byagura iri garagazambere.
mask_refine.duplicate_note = Igisohoka: igice gishya gifite amabara yo ku nkombe yakosowe na masike. Igice cy'umwimerere kirindwa kandi kigahishwa.
