mask_refine.locked = Fungura iki gice mbere yo kunonosora masike yacyo.
mask_refine.no_mask = Banza uhitemo agace cyangwa wongereho masike y'igice.
mask_refine.changed = Inyandiko yahindutse. Funga Kunonosora Masike maze wongere uyifungure.
mask_refine.rgb_only = Gukuraho impeta z'amabara biboneka ku bice bya RGB. Kunonosora masike bikorera muri ubu buryo bw'amabara.
mask_refine.too_large = Masike irenze urugero rw'ububiko bwizewe. Koresha inyandiko cyangwa ihitamo rito.
mask_refine.processing = Masike y'ingano yuzuye irimo kunonosorwa… Ushobora kubireka udahinduye inyandiko.
